    <div style="display:grid;gap:10px;">
      <details style="padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:12px;background:hsl(var(--card));"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">How do we know if AI automation is right for us?</summary><p style="margin:10px 0 0;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));line-height:1.6;">Start with the AI Opportunity Audit. In 1 to 2 weeks we map workflows, score opportunities by ROI and risk, and tell you honestly what to automate, what to integrate, and what to leave alone.</p></details>
      <details style="padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:12px;background:hsl(var(--card));"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">What does a typical project look like?</summary><p style="margin:10px 0 0;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));line-height:1.6;">Most engagements run 4 to 10 weeks: discovery, prototype, productionization, evals and handover. We work in two-week iterations with weekly demos.</p></details>
      <details style="padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:12px;background:hsl(var(--card));"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">Do we need a data team in place?</summary><p style="margin:10px 0 0;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));line-height:1.6;">No. We bring the engineering. If you already have a data team, we slot in alongside them and follow your standards.</p></details>
